CONTROLS:

INVENTORY
The inventory is navigated by scrolling through the list of furniture
items. If you want to switch to a different section, you click on the
tabs on the left. 

PLACING FURNITURE
To place a furniture, drag it from the inventory into the game space.
You are able to replace a furniture to another position by just dragging
it again.

REMOVING FURNITURE
To remove a furniture from the game space, drag it back to the inventory

FURNITURE ATTRIBUTES
To view each specific furniture's attributes, hover over the furniture in
the inventory and a panel will appear listing the attributes.

CLIENT REQUIREMENTS
To view client requirements, click on the "Client" button in the top menu
of each level. To hide the panel, reclick on that same "Client" button.

REORDERING FURNITURE ORDER
There is the ability to "bring forward" or "bring back" furniture items that
are currently placed in the game space. To do so, click on the furniture you
want to reorder and it will turn an orange. Then use the up arrow to bring
forward and the down arrow to bring back.
